# ContractLens — Environment Variables
#
# The core MVP requires NO environment variables. The analysis pipeline
# (text extraction, clause segmentation, rule-based risk engine, scoring,
# and explanations) runs entirely in this application with no external
# services, API keys, or database.
#
# The variables below are placeholders for OPTIONAL future extensions
# described in the README (e.g. an AI-enhanced analyzer, or Supabase
# persistence for contract history). Nothing below is read by the app today.

# --- Optional future: AI-enhanced analysis (not used by the core MVP) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Optional future: Supabase persistence for contract history ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
